{
  "slug": "retrieve-the-forgotten-memory",
  "name": "Retrieve The Forgotten Memory",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Indexes your project — code, markdown, PDFs, legal text, research notes into a local SQLite file. Claude searches it before grepping. No API keys, no cloud, nothing leaves your machine.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**, **2 commands**, **4 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `expand` (Read the full content of a specific file or section previously returned by rtfm_search), `install-embeddings` (Install the embeddings extra (fastembed, ~85 MB ONNX model) into an isolated venv), `install-pdf` (Install the light PDF parser (pdftext, ~50 MB) into an isolated venv), `install-pdf-full` (Install the full PDF parser (pdftext + marker-pdf + CPU-only torch, ~1.5 GB) into an isolated venv), `search` (Search the RTFM-indexed corpus of the current project (code, docs, data))\n- **Commands** (2): `rtfm.ocr` (Enable persistent OCR fallback for scanned PDFs and run the OCR pass in the background), `rtfm.status` (Show full RTFM index status (with pending-sync counts and health signals))\n- **Hooks** (4): `SessionStart`, `PostToolUse`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `Stop`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `rtfm`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install retrieve-the-forgotten-memory@claude-community` from `roomi-fields/rtfm`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 5,
    "hook": 4,
    "command": 2,
    "mcp": 1
  },
